        <h2>Which Springs Come With Your Kit, and <span class="text-green">What to Upgrade To</span></h2>
        <p>Every Nitron kit comes with Nitron springs as standard; every Penske kit comes with Eibach. Both are good springs. The question is whether to upgrade.</p>

        <div class="table-wrap">
          <table class="spec-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
